## 3. STAGE 0 / 1 / 2 composition (still “the suit” until they drop)

| Stage | Job | Composition |
|---|---|---|
| 0 | Pad, 85–100 kN class, max-q | Drop tanks + engine cluster at the boots / yoke; acoustic load into exo not into faces; jettison before orbit |
| 1 | Finish LEO / set up TLI | Hydrolox or methalox tanks as a dorsal “fat pack”; drop |
| 2 | TLI, LOI, lunar landing | Landing legs that are the greave scales or a deployable yoke gear; engines as Stage 0 leftovers or a dedicated cluster |

All dropped stages are EcoSuit-shaped tanks in the artwork. In mass properties they are stages.

Feedstock if you insist on belt metal later: Grade A FeNi tanks are possible. Grade A FeNi heat shield is not.

