## 5. Mass order (closed, not worn-pretty)

| Block | Order of magnitude |
|---|---|
| Crew + CORE shell + shield + LS + TEI engines (dry) | 2–5 t if you are ruthless; higher if you are honest |
| Wet CORE after Stage 2 drop (TEI + RCS + LS) | several tonnes |
| Wet SOLO on the pad (all stages) | **tens of tonnes** |
| Walk-off after landing (shell + crew, stages and char gone) | ~0.25–0.4 t if the CORE can shed the shield and empty tanks |

If a number on a poster is 250 kg wet Earth-to-Moon-and-back, the poster is art.

