## 7. Title block

- SOLO is a staged vehicle that keeps a suit silhouette.
- Composition of the walk-off garment ≠ composition of the pad article.
- Earth landing is a heat shield + chutes/burn, not a hemp sandwich.
- No spacecraft means you *are* the spacecraft. Own the tonnes.
